WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.240
So, you know,

2
00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:02.520
a lot of people have heard the idea

3
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.770
that they should start small or build small habits,

4
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.730
but even when you know you should start small,

5
00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.910
it's still really easy to start too big.

6
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:10.840
So for example,

7
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:13.250
if you're trying to start a running habit,

8
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:14.380
then a lot of people say,

9
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.330
okay, I wanna run,

10
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.100
but I know that I should start small,

11
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.850
so let me just run for 15 minutes.

12
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:20.800
But even that is like way bigger

13
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.740
than what I'm talking about,

14
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:22.820
I'm talking about take your habit

15
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.350
and scale it down into the first two minutes.

16
00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.650
So the habit would be,

17
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.120
I put on my running shoes

18
00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.170
and I step out the door.

19
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.400
And if you do anything else more than that,

20
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.070
it's just a bonus.

21
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:32.620
If you go for a run,

22
00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:33.270
it's just a bonus.

23
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.900
Now, some people will hear that and think that,

24
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:37.440
oh, this kind of sounds

25
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:38.640
like a gimmick or a trick,

26
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.350
like I know the real goal is to run,

27
00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.340
I know it's not just

28
00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.290
to put my shoes on.

29
00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.320
But if you feel that way,

30
00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:47.080
I would encourage you to do literally the opposite,

31
00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.150
to stop after two minutes.

32
00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:52.120
And the point of this entire exercise

33
00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:53.300
is to get yourself

34
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:54.940
to master the art of showing up.

35
00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.010
So the very first thing,

36
00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.840
and this is the ultimate answer to your question

37
00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:00.150
of what do you focus on first,

38
00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:01.600
when you're building a new habit,

39
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:02.900
the very first thing you need to master

40
00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:04.150
is the art of showing up.

41
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.260
A habit must be established

42
00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.790
before it can be improved.

43
00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.220
If you don't have a habit to begin with,

44
00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:11.490
you don't have anything to optimize.

45
00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:13.540
And so, as an example,

46
00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:14.340
I had a reader

47
00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.110
who he ended up losing a hundred pounds.

48
00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:19.540
And one of the ways that he did it

49
00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.060
was that he went to the gym,

50
00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:22.580
but he wasn't allowed to stay

51
00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:23.580
for more than five minutes.

52
00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:26.080
He would show up, walk in,

53
00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:27.150
maybe do an exercise,

54
00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:28.660
and then once the clock hit five minutes

55
00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:29.540
or his watch hit five minutes,

56
00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:30.370
he would walk out the door.

57
00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:32.270
And he did this for like six weeks.

58
00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:34.220
And eventually he was like, you know,

59
00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:35.120
I'm coming here all the time,

60
00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:36.470
I might as well start staying longer,

61
00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:38.150
doing a better workout or whatever.

62
00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:40.360
And that sounds funny to people

63
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:41.530
when they first hear it,

64
00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:42.600
but the point is

65
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:44.310
that he was mastering the art of showing up.
